    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29898" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">multĭ-gĕnus</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">multĭ-gĕnĕrus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		multus-genus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of many kinds, various</i> (<b>poet.</b> and post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">multigenis variata figuris,</span>”
